    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIRCAL\nSYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEffective August 15, 1982\nNOW SERVING\nSAN FRANCISCO FROM BURBANK.",
      "AIRCAL\nN478AC\nAIRCAL\nAIRCAL MAKES IT MORE CONVENIENT THAN EVER\nTO FLY BETWEEN SAN FRANCISCO AND LOS ANGELES.\nSeasoned travelers know how\nto slip in and out of Los Angeles\nwith the least amount of\nOAKLAND\nhassle. They arrive and\ndepart from Burbank\nAirport. Besides being\nSAN FRANCISCO\n•\nless crowded, Burbank is\nthe most convenient air-\nSAN JOSE\nport for a lot of Los Angeles-\nfrom downtown to Beverly Hills\nto Hollywood to Pasadena, and\nof course, the San Fernando Val-\nley. And AirCal adds convenience\nto convenience, with one-stop check\nin and advance seat selection. Plus\nthe kind of attention that makes you feel\nSACRAMENTO\nyou're the only passenger So next time\nyou're flying between San Francisco and\nLos Angeles, add a little convenience to\nyour life: Burbank.\nBURBANK\nOfficial airline of Universal Studio Tours®"
    ],
